<p style="color: red; font-size: 1em;">Left Hand Level: <<=$body_level_map[$userBody.left_hand.curr_body]>></p>
<p style="color: red; font-size: 1em;">Right Hand Level: <<=$body_level_map[$userBody.right_hand.curr_body]>></p>
