/* <<=$next_passage>> */
<br>
[[Move Forth|$next_passage]] | <br><br>
[[Skip Conversation with Thalara|use_success_potion_create_head]]
<</nobr>>


:: use_success_potion_create_head {"position":"225,13600","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
